g block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/7cdcf6180db0cd5fdb51551dd0e01d417978563e/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-4763-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/b0d430b04993cd88e8cca96e8dabaa54348d3d6c/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-4763-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time (1998)" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/7cdcf6180db0cd5fdb51551dd0e01d417978563e/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-4763-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time (1998)"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>1. </span><span>The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time (1998)</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Nov 23, 1998</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> E</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>As a young boy, Link is tricked by Ganondorf, the King of the Gerudo Thieves. The evil human uses Link to gain access to the Sacred Realm, where he places his tainted hands on Triforce and transforms the beautiful Hyrulean landscape into a barren wasteland. Link is determined to fix the problems he helped to create, so with the help of Rauru he travels through time gathering the powers of the Seven Sages.</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 99 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 99 out of 100"><span>99</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="truncate font-bold">Nintendo 64</span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/soulcalibur/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" dat