globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/b6f572d1fca2c64ed28ff9352e7fbbc1d58b7117/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-674478-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/a391c932d04de65695ab62cc14306afe9a978bb3/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-674478-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="Red Dead Redemption 2" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/b6f572d1fca2c64ed28ff9352e7fbbc1d58b7117/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-674478-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="Red Dead Redemption 2"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>9. </span><span>Red Dead Redemption 2</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Oct 26, 2018</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> M</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>Developed by the creators of Grand Theft Auto V and Red Dead Redemption, Red Dead Redemption 2 is an epic tale of life in America’s unforgiving heartland. The game’s vast and atmospheric world also provides the foundation for a brand new online multiplayer experience. America, 1899. The end of the Wild West era has begun. After a robbery goes badly wrong in the western town of Blackwater, Arthur Morgan and the Van der Linde gang are forced to flee. With federal agents and the best bounty hunters in the nation massing on their heels, the gang has to rob, steal and fight their way across the rugged heartland of America in order to survive. As deepening internal fissures threaten to tear the gang apart, Arthur must make a choice between his own ideals and loyalty to the gang that raised him. [Rockstar]</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 97 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 97 out of 100"><span>97</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="iconify i-mc-platform:ps4logo h-8" aria-hidden="true" style="" title="PlayStation 4"></span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/grand-theft-auto-v/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/1b95f418f80acb34c8edaeb422270df55c89e7d7/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-675075-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/30bf0b7066ea093bebf3423597ded475fe6d5869/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-675075-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="Grand Theft Auto V" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/1b95f418f80acb34c8edaeb422270df55c89e7d7/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-675075-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="Grand Theft Auto V"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>10. </span><span>Grand Theft Auto V</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Nov 18, 2014</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> M</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>The sprawling sun-soaked metropolis of Los Santos is chock full of self-help coaches, starlets and C-List celebrities, once on top of the media world, now struggling to stay relevant in time of economic malaise and lowest-common-denominator reality TV. Amidst this madness, three unique criminals plan their own chances of survival and success: Franklin, a street-level hustler in search of opportunities for serious money; Michael, an ex-con whose &quot;retirement&quot; is a less rosy than he hoped it would be; and Trevor, a violent dude driven by the chance for a quick high and the next big score. Nearly out of options, the crew risks it all in a series of daring and dangerous heists that could set them up for life - one way or the other.</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 97 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 97 out of 100"><span>97</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="iconify i-mc-platform:ps4logo h-8" aria-hidden="true" style="" title="PlayStation 4"></span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/metroid-prime/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><pictur