xt-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>Samus returns in a new mission to unravel the mystery behind the ruined walls scattered across Tallon IV. In Metroid Prime, you&#39;ll play the role of this bounty hunter and view the world through her visor, which displays information ranging from current energy levels to ammunition. Equipped with a Power Beam and Gravity Suit, you must shoot locked switches, solve puzzles, and eliminate enemies. It&#39;s up to you to explore the world and recover more power-ups and weapons, which gradually open more gameplay areas.</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 97 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 97 out of 100"><span>97</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="truncate font-bold">GameCube</span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/grand-theft-auto-iii/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/fe7d437804f1810e637900b72ba62a96c09457b2/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-12649-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/a1bae9579a627f8bc5c83c6f5841ba258f7e7d40/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-12649-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="Grand Theft Auto III" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/fe7d437804f1810e637900b72ba62a96c09457b2/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-12649-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="Grand Theft Auto III"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>12. </span><span>Grand Theft Auto III</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Oct 22, 2001</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> M</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>Players are put at the heart of their very own gangster movie, and let loose in a fully-realised 3 dimensional city with a cast of hundreds, 50 plus vehicles, ranging from sports cars to ice cream trucks and from boats to buses, 3 hours of music, including opera, reggae, house, drum and bass, pop and disco, and a huge array of street ready weapons.  [Rockstar Games]</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 97 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 97 out of 100"><span>97</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="truncate font-bold">PlayStation 2</span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><div class="w-full"><div class="fandom-ad-wrapper fandom-ad-placeholder min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px] min-[768px]:min-w-[728px] min-[768px]:min-h-[250px] min-[1024px]:min-w-[970px] min-[1024px]:min-h-[250px] fando