-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>15. </span><span>NFL 2K1</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Sep 7, 2000</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> E</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>In the end, NFL 2K1 is a deeper, more refined version of the original game.</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 97 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 97 out of 100"><span>97</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="truncate font-bold">Dreamcast</span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/half-life-2/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/a325ae4172312e4b4061ec52ca11b1ed5299834a/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-43965-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/d8c56650c3ebb4de0c722a5a3d4fc8d2cc47856d/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-43965-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="Half-Life 2" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/a325ae4172312e4b4061ec52ca11b1ed5299834a/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-43965-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="Half-Life 2"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>16. </span><span>Half-Life 2</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Nov 16, 2004</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> M</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>[Metacritic&#39;s 2004 PC Game of the Year]  By taking the suspense, challenge and visceral charge of the original, and adding startling new realism and responsiveness, Half-Life 2 opens the door to a world where the player&#39;s presence affects everything around him, from the physical environment to the behaviors -- even the emotions -- of both friends and enemies. The player again picks up the crowbar of research scientist Gordon Freeman, who finds himself on an alien-infested Earth being picked to the bone, its resources depleted, its populace dwindling. Freeman is thrust into the unenviable role of rescuing the world from the wrong he unleashed back at Black Mesa. And a lot of people -- people he cares about -- are counting on him. [Vivendi Universal]</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 96 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 96 out of 100"><span>96</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="iconify i-mc-platform:pclogo h-4" aria-hidden="true" style="" title="PC"></span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><div class="w-full"><div class="fandom-ad-wrapper fandom-ad-placeholder min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px] min-[768px]:min-w-[728px] min-[768px]:min-h-[250px] min-[1024px]:min-w-[970px] min-[1024px]:min-h-[250px] fandom-ad-slot-type-display pt-4 px-0 pb-0 bg-gray-50" data-v-0330ea43><!--[--><fandom-ad id="incontent_leaderboard_3" class="fandom-ad-placeholder min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px] min-[768px]:min-w-[728px] min-[768px]:min-h-[250px] min-[1024px]:min-w-[970px] min-[1024px]:min-h-[250px]" data-ad-unit-path="/5441/metacritic.display/incontent_leaderboard_3/desktop/browse" data-v-95726591></fandom-ad><div id="label-incontent_leaderboard_3" class="fandom-ad-label ae-translatable-label" data-v-a20209ff>Advertisement</div><!--]--></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/bioshock/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/86f206daa69664069471ab0ad243ac6036ebc132/catalog/provider/6/12/6-1-63862-52.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/1d7c995d2357543246738775be175ffc2ae53840/catalog/provider/6/12/6-1-63862-52.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="BioShock" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/86f206daa69664069471ab0ad243ac6036ebc132/catalog/provider/6/12/6-1-63862-52.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="BioShock"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>17. </span><span>BioShock</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Aug 21, 2007</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> M</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>[Metacritic&#39;s 2007 Xbox 360 Game of the Year] Going beyond &quot;run and gun corridors,&quot; &quot;monster-closet AIs&quot; and static worlds, BioShock creates a living, unique and unpredictable FPS experience. After your plane crashes into icy uncharted waters, you discover a rusted bathysphere and descend into Rapture, a city hidden beneath the sea. Constructed as an idealistic society for a hand picked group of scientists, artists and industrialists, the idealism is no more. Now the city is littered with corpses, wildly powerful guardians roam the corridors as little girls loot the dead, and genetically mutated citizens ambush you at every turn. Take control of your world by hacking mechanical devices, commandeering security turrets and crafting unique items critical to your very survival. Upgrade your weapons with ionic gels, explosives and toxins to customize them to the enemy and environment. Genetically modify your body through dozens of Plasmid Stations scattered throughout the city, empowering you with fantastic and often grotesque abilities. Explore a living world powered by Ecological A.I., where the inhabitants have interesting and consequential relationships with one another that impact your gameplay experience. Experience truly next generation graphics that vividly illustrate the forlorn art deco city, highlighted by the most detailed and realistic water effects ever developed in a video game. Make meaningful choices and mature decisions, ultimately culminating in the grand question: do you exploit the innocent survivors of Rapture...or save them? [2K Games]</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 96 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 96 out of 100"><span>96</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="iconify i-mc-platform:xbox360logo h-8" aria-hidden="true" style="" title="Xbox 360"></span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/goldeneye-007/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/a10415af3d2502d0bed39d324649ed55ddda9462/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-3971-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/7da0a9681ca0dd372acd9a0bb6fff69a93a0d165/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-3971-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="GoldenEye 007" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/a10415af3d2502d0bed39d324649ed55ddda9462/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-3971-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="GoldenEye 007"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>18. </span><span>GoldenEye 007</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Aug 25, 1997</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> T</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>You are Bond. James Bond. You are assigned covert operations connected with the GoldenEye weapons satellite. M will brief you on your mission and objectives from London. Q Branch will support your efforts with a plentiful supply of weapons and gadgets. Moneypenny offers you light-hearted best wishes and you&#39;re off! Your mission begins in the heavily guarded chemical warfare facility at the Byelomorye Dam in the USSR. Look and shoot in any direction as you navigate 12 interactive 3-D environments. Use stealth and force as you see fit in matters of international security. Consider the military personnel expendable. You are licensed to kill!</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 96 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 96 out of 100"><span>96</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="truncate font-bold">Nintendo 64</span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/uncharted-2-among-thieves/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/64f71f716070a657f5f1200443eed7e51f76febe/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-106607-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/3c524979ac918b3be7fc994ce31d0528be65b73c/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-106607-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="Uncharted 2: Among Thieves" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/64f71f716070a657f5f1200443eed7e51f76febe/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-106607-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="Uncharted 2: Among Thieves"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>19. </span><span>Uncharted 2: Among Thieves</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Oct 13, 2009</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> T</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>Fortune hunter Nathan Drake returns in Uncharted 2: Among Thieves, a third-person action-adventure/shooter created by award-winning developer Naughty Dog. Down on his luck, Drake is lured back into the treacherous world of thieves and mercenary treasure-seekers he had sought to leave behind. When a mysterious artifact propels Drake on an expedition to find the legendary Himalayan valley of Shambhala, he finds himself embroiled in a dangerous game of cat-and-mouse against a fugitive war criminal who’s after more than just the fabled riches of the lost city. Caught in a web of deception and plunged into an increasingly deadly pursuit that tests the limits of his endurance, Drake will be forced to risk everything - but has his luck finally run out? [SCEA]</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 96 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 96 out of 100"><span>96</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="iconify i-mc-platform:ps3logo h-8" aria-hidden="true" style="" title="PlayStation 3"></span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/resident-evil-4-2005/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/9115a6eafc0b0909582b6d2f6fb53662b3e950d4/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-15522-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/4696604d97ee6c794aa177e039abc840766ee74a/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-15522-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="Resident Evil 4 (2005)" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/9115a6eafc0b0909582b6d2f6fb53662b3e950d4/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-15522-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="Resident Evil 4 (2005)"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>20. </span><span>Resident Evil 4 (2005)</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Jan 11, 2005</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> M</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>Resident Evil 4 marks a new chapter in the Resident Evil series. You&#39;ll rejoin Leon S. Kennedy six years after his first mission as a rookie cop from Resident Evil 2. Now a US agent, Leon is on a top secret mission to investigate the disappearance of the president&#39;s daughter. As Leon, you must make your way to a mysterious location in Europe, where new enemies await. Take them down by using enhanced aim-and-shoot features and a new action button.</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 96 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 96 out of 100"><span>96</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="truncate font-bold">GameCube</span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><div class="w-full"><div class="fandom-ad-wrapper fandom-ad-placeholder min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px] min-[768px]:min-w-[728px] min-[768px]:min-h-[250px] min-[1024px]:min-w-[970px] min-[1024px]:min-h-[250px] fandom-ad-slot-type-display pt-4 px-0 pb-0 bg-gray-50" data-v-0330ea43><!--[--><fandom-ad id="incontent_leaderboard_4" class="fandom-ad-placeholder min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px] min-[768px]:min-w-[728px] min-[768px]:min-h-[250px] min-[1024px]:min-w-[970px] min-[1024px]:min-h-[250px]" data-ad-unit-path="/5441/metacritic.display/incontent_leaderboard_4/desktop/browse" data-v-95726591></fandom-ad><div id="label-incontent_leaderboard_4" class="fandom-ad-label ae-translatable-label" data-v-a20209ff>Advertisement</div><!--]--></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/baldurs-gate-3/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/fdd080091c66b6b2729e648b2511495a47bdb824/catalog/provider/7/2/7-1695438055.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/7c2e18af6c52088e8381708504acbddee825183a/catalog/provider/7/2/7-1695438055.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="Baldur&#39;s Gate 3" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/fdd080091c66b6b2729e648b2511495a47bdb824/catalog/provider/7/2/7-1695438055.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="Baldur&#39;s Gate 3"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>21. </span><span>Baldur&#39;s Gate 3</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Aug 3, 2023</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> M</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>An ancient evil has returned to Baldur&#39;s Gate, intent on devouring it from the inside out. The fate of Faerun lies in your hands. Alone, you may resist. But together, you can overcome. Gather your party and return to the Forgotten Realms in a tale of fellowship and betrayal, sacrifice and survival, and the lure of absolute power. Mysterious abilities are awakening inside you, drawn from a mind flayer parasite planted in your brain. Resist, and turn darkness against itself. Or embrace corruption, and become ultimate evil.</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 96 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 96 out of 100"><span>96</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="iconify i-mc-platform:pclogo h-4" aria-hidden="true" style="" title="PC"></span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/the-orange-box/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/b568dda54b87657b804808d0da8bae87bb06356f/catalog/provider/6/12/6-1-78321-52.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/fdb1f4570d9b3eeaabf8cd1ce3cef9311286b7d0/catalog/provider/6/12/6-1-78321-52.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="The Orange Box" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/b568dda54b87657b804808d0da8bae87bb06356f/catalog/provider/6/12/6-1-78321-52.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="The Orange Box"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>22. </span><span>The Orange Box</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Oct 10, 2007</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> M</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>Games included in The Orange Box compilation: The original Half-Life 2 - The player again picks up the crowbar of research scientist Gordon Freeman, who finds himself on an alien-infested Earth being picked to the bone, its resources depleted, its populace dwindling. Freeman is thrust into the unenviable role of rescuing the world from the wrong he unleashed back at Black Mesa. And a lot of people - people he cares about - are counting on him. Half-Life 2: Episode One - The player reprises his role of Dr. Freeman, who must immediately face the repercussions of his actions in City 17 and the Citadel. Freeman reconnects with Alyx Vance and her robot, Dog, as they continue their support of the resistance&#39;s battle against the Combine forces.  Half-Life 2: Episode Two -- the second installment in Valve&#39;s episodic trilogy advances the award-winning story, leading the player to new locations outside of City 17. Portal - a pioneering type of single player action game that rewrites the rules for how players approach and manipulate their environment – much like how Half-Life 2&#39;s Gravity Gun reinvented the way gamers interact with objects in the game. Team Fortress 2 - an all-new version of the legendary title that spawned team based multiplayer action games. The game&#39;s daring new art style features the most advanced graphics of any Source-based game released to date. [Valve Software]</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 96 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 96 out of 100"><span>96</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="iconify i-mc-platform:xbox360logo h-8" aria-hidden="true" style="" title="Xbox 360"></span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/tekken-3/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/f94772e1ed27328d66c9a482693bbce86d564b41/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-7967-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/1eb69fbd1bb789cd0553797e864422317eb06f10/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-7967-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="Tekken 3" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/f94772e1ed27328d66c9a482693bbce86d564b41/catalog/provider/6/3/6-1-7967-13.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="Tekken 3"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>23. </span><span>Tekken 3</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Apr 29, 1998</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> T</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>An ancient evil force has reawakened, attacking in secret and feeding on the souls of mighty warriors. To lure it out of hiding will take the greatest fighting contest the world has ever seen...Tekken 3. Some are fighting for revenge, some for honor, Ultimately, all are fighting for their lives and the fate of all mankind.</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 96 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 96 out of 100"><span>96</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="truncate font-bold">PlayStation</span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div class="relative overflow-hidden shrink-0 grow-0 p-4 rounded-lg shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_0.125rem_1rem_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] transition-shadow" data-testid="filter-results"><!----><a class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_auto] gap-x-1 gap-y-1 md:gap-x-4 text-gray-800 no-underline" href="/game/mass-effect-2/" rel="follow" target="_self"><!--[--><div class="shrink-0 relative w-18.5 h-[6.938rem] md:w-22 md:h-33"><div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-gray-900"><div class="relative block w-full w-full h-full [&amp;_img]:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio:96 / 144;" data-testid="product-image"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="c-globalImagePlaceholder c-globalImagePlaceholder--vertical c-globalImagePlaceholder--radius-medium" style="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-245df785><div class="content" data-v-245df785><span class="iconify i-core:mc-logo-placeholder svg-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-245df785></span></div></div><!--]--><div class="absolute inset-0 block h-full" style="z-index:1;"><picture class="rounded-lg block w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><!--[--><!--]--><img width="96" height="144" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/bedcf2e558ebe8cc65440581c5c04ee185b2fbcc/catalog/provider/6/12/6-1-657262-52.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96 1x, https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/bf0b122dfb72b77455947d95e22b447c1781a546/catalog/provider/6/12/6-1-657262-52.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=288&amp;quality=70&amp;width=192 2x" onerror="this.style.visibility = &#39;hidden&#39;" alt="Mass Effect 2" class="block w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" src="https://www.metacritic.com/a/img/resize/bedcf2e558ebe8cc65440581c5c04ee185b2fbcc/catalog/provider/6/12/6-1-657262-52.jpg?auto=webp&amp;fit=cover&amp;height=144&amp;quality=70&amp;width=96"></picture></div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 w-auto h-auto"><div class="score-badge__container [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:w-11.25 [&amp;_.score-badge__image]:h-11.25" data-testid="score-badge" data-v-c84c76f3><div class="c-global-image score-badge__image" data-v-c84c76f3 data-v-643df079><img src="/a/neutron/nodev4/images/logos/badge/must-play.svg" alt="must-play" width="52" height="52" loading="lazy" style="object-fit:cover;" class="c-global-image__img" data-v-643df079></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative transition-opacity mb-1 group" data-title="Mass Effect 2"><h3 data-testid="product-title" class="m-0 text-base leading-5.5 font-bold lg:overflow-hidden lg:text-ellipsis lg:line-clamp-1 lg:max-h-5.5 lg:wrap-break-word"><span>24. </span><span>Mass Effect 2</span></h3></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-1 wrap-break-word text-xs leading-6 max-h-6 uppercase mb-1"><span>Jan 26, 2010</span><span>  •  </span><span><span class="capitalize">Rated</span> M</span></div><div class="overflow-hidden text-ellipsis line-clamp-2 wrap-break-word mb-1 text-sm leading-5 max-h-10"><span>The Mass Effect trilogy is a science fiction adventure set in a vast universe filled with dangerous alien life forms and mysterious uncharted planets. In this dark second chapter, Saren’s evil army of Geth soldiers has just been defeated, and humans, who are still struggling to make their mark on the galactic stage, are now faced with an even greater peril. [BioWare]</span></div><div class="text-xs leading-6 min-h-6 mt-auto flex items-center flex-wrap justify-between"><span class="inline-flex items-center"><div class="c-siteReviewScore_background c-siteReviewScore_background-critic_xsmall inline-flex items-center h-full mr-1"><div class="c-siteReviewScore c-siteReviewScore_green c-siteReviewScore_xsmall c-siteReviewScore_square bg-[#00ce7a] text-[#262626] size-6 text-xs leading-4 rounded-[0.125rem] flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold" title="Metascore 96 out of 100" aria-label="Metascore 96 out of 100"><span>96</span></div></div><span>Metascore</span></span><span class="hidden md:flex gap-1 ml-auto"><!--[--><span class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center min-w-0"><span class="iconify i-mc-platform:xbox360logo h-8" aria-hidden="true" style="" title="Xbox 360"></span></div></span><!--]--><!----></span></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><div class="mb-6 text-center"><!--[--><div data-testid="navigation-pagination"><nav class="c-navigation-pagination mt-6" data-testid="navigation-pagination" data-v